OL,3,GNEWSACrash fears grow at school route
OL,4,Ajunction
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents living beside a crash-hit
OL,7,Fjunction say they fear it is only a
OL,8,Fmatter of time before a child is
OL,9,Fseriously injured unless safety
OL,10,Fimprovements are made.
OL,12,FPaul Hildreth, who lives near the
OL,13,Fjunction of Chart Lane, Waterlow Road
OL,14,Fand Belmont Road in Reigate, said the
OL,15,Fsituation was "problematic".
OL,17,F"We have had several incidents of
OL,18,Fcrashes and the last two, recently,
OL,19,Fboth cars ended up bashing into my
OL,20,Fwall," he said.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
